Until a commercial license is executed, firms at or above the $10M
threshold have no rights to use, copy, or distribute this software.

======================================================================
DEFINITIONS
======================================================================

  "Firm" means the legal entity (or consolidated group of entities under
  common ownership) that will use the software. If your firm is part of a
  parent company or holding group, the relevant revenue is the consolidated
  annual revenue of the entire group, not just the subsidiary.

  "Annual revenue" means total revenue recognized in the most recent
  completed fiscal year, as reported in your firm's financial statements
  or tax returns, whichever is higher.

  "Software" means the firm-stack plugin, including all SKILL.md files,
  scripts, templates, references, and associated documentation contained
  in this repository.

